    "reason": "MG5_aMC adds an R2 coupling only for a loop whose propagator set equals its loop-particle label (set_LoopCT_vertices); in 't Hooft-Feynman gauge every b loop of the t~ t G0 vertex holds a G+- (G0 has no W W vertex), so R2_G0tt_b ([W+, b]) is never added, while R2_Htt_b is (the H W W triangle). Both couplings multiply V_ttG02's one structure, so the omitted term is (R2_G0tt_b / R2_G0tt) x r2_g0tt, the Born x CT interference of the R2_G0tt amplitudes."
